Obtaining Corresponding Source
==============================

For the GNU-family components (the Linux kernel, BusyBox, glibc, GRUB, nano),
the Corresponding Source is available from the upstream projects listed above.
`build.sh` and the "Build" section of README.md document how the kernel and
BusyBox are configured and compiled, so that the exact binaries shipped in the
mnOS image can be reproduced from source.
